simulator lang=spectre
subckt rf_two8_v12 (rf clk vdd vss)
C0 (rf g0) capacitor c=1p
R0 (g0 a) resistor r=20k
X0 (g0 a vdd vss) pll_inv wn=8u wp=20.0u
C1 (a g1) capacitor c=1p
R1 (g1 b) resistor r=20k
X1 (g1 b vdd vss) pll_inv wn=8u wp=20.0u
XO (b clk vdd vss) pll_inv wn=16u wp=40.0u
ends rf_two8_v12
